heptapod@gmail.com wrote:
> I know that I can reliably wish for 5 potions and 5000 gold, but how
> many scrolls of a certain species can I wish for in NetHack?

You can't reliably wish for 5 potions. With both potions and scrolls,
you will either get the number you wish for, or 1, at random. The lower
the number, the larger the chance that you get that number rather than 1.

The maximum you can possibly get is 5; this has a 1 in 6 chance if you
wish for 5 of the object (giving you just one scroll with a 5 in 6
chance). If you want the best possible average number of scrolls/potions
with each wish (say, you've been farming and have a lot of wishes to
spare), wish for 3; this has a 1 in 2 chance of giving 3, and a 1 in 2
chance of giving you 1. If it's an item with heavily diminishing returns
(such as scrolls of genocide or scrolls of charging; the first one is
very useful, the second somewhat useful, the thir more niche), you might
want to wish for just 2 of an item. Wishing for 1, or more than 5, is
always pointless because you'll always get just the one potion/scroll,
and a wish for 2, 3, 4, or 5 is stictly better.

(Information based on
http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Wish#Wishing_for_quantities and checked
against the source code for accuracy.)

